acrimonious-reader (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Form lines: runs of underscores get a green marker while the writing
    toolbar is shown. Clicking one starts a text box on the line, in the
    underscores' font size and in dark green.

 -- Kevin Boergens <kevin.boergens@gmail.com>  Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:33:33 +0000

acrimonious-reader (1.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Install the program to /usr/lib/acrimonious-reader. With `make install`
    into ~/.local the old place was the user's data folder, so reinstalling
    or uninstalling deleted saved signatures.

 -- Kevin Boergens <kevin.boergens@gmail.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:22:25 +0000

acrimonious-reader (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Saved signatures: draw a signature once on a signing pad, or save a
    drawing from a page, and place it on any document with a click.
  * Resize text boxes and drawings with a handle on their corner.
  * Saving a file that may be written but not replaced now overwrites it in
    place.

 -- Kevin Boergens <kevin.boergens@gmail.com>  Mon, 05 Oct 2026 15:59:52 +0000

acrimonious-reader (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: a PDF viewer with text boxes and freehand drawing.

